Package: traceR
Type: Package
Title: Functions for simple operations to analyse 1D chromatographic data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ivan", "Podkolzin", , "nizlokdop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0851-747X"))
  )
Description: The traceR package provides functionality to load, handle, 
    process and compare single-channeled chromatographic traces. The processing
    includes resampling of data points, trace alignment, signal normalization,
    and cropping. Computing similarity and distance metrics allows to get an objective
    comparision of traces. Every processing step can be visulised using 
    a dedicated plotting function. 
